<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States signed a military cooperation agreement with Venezuela's interim government and a U.S. marine died after falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed ties. Former oil minister Machado called for a more drastic overhaul of the oil sector amid hyperinflation, food shortages, massive emigration and socioeconomic collapse. Grassroots groups rejected the agreement as a normalization of subordination while military prisoners entered a third week without food and families took the fight to court. The U.S. Senate panel is investigating JD Vance's ties to a prized Venezuelan oil contract, and UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNcXNHRzZxSXRIbENTdUYwdUh0eTZHWTJBb1diaGRXYm8tTTBRWTFRTk9Lc3FsbW1kb1g5QTg0eXZEbHdHNFVyWUl2ZzhxNDloajNfeDUyV0dKVVQ2QjA3UUU2S3NoaXZ1OUVhMGMtamxNMFpTTFhxT2NUTUNJTDl6TlVJSFNTWENydE1sUWNiM1o3SzIySUVTV1JUbzE2TVI5YktHb1AzZlZIUnJsR2lYLVp2RzhpTDdHbzZUVmZmRTAzYjFZejZWbkRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE04T3VfUWZ2aVVrZWNkOV9HQUtFOWY2NllLcW5QQlFNb3A5RmN4dm95M042MV8zekpublZacjNCNUN0UFN1NHpwVGZTTUdYQWRuQzZaLTJKUEV5c1dLc3dZYWdtVnlNak0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1wTlFwcUNWamNOQTVaUUxVT2k0UVB4SEs3Ykh4WW9uel96MXV6MUhqQktJbVgyQ1h6eWlQUEVMaGZYODBvalpzRHpZeC1yRjBOeWZnVzBnbHdwMWpmYXBKS2FPM1dWRVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE82ZzNjSXFRSWxITTROQk9IcXBwa01ZYm9pQ2VZWU9QbFA4ZHdwVWNueEdPSklWMmRMLTh1WHR2T1R3c2NyYXdNZC03OW03TFI4THB1V016OGtUVGRodkhSaEp6YnJ4Zm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1CNGFESWlsQ3lnMGZfdVlNSXRfT1ByS1F